        "content": "<p>Gelbpunkt <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14771#issuecomment-6200806350\">commented</a> on <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14771\">PR #14771</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p>is LE planned?</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>I don't have immediate plans for that because our usecase in rustc_codegen_cranelift doesn't require it. Could potentially look into it as a follow-up once <code>atomic_rmw</code> is also done.</p>\n</blockquote>",
